{"id":"a83339712ea1a677","group":"14","path":"14/14-thm-sheaf-topos-points.md","title":"Theorem — Continuous Flat Functors and Points of a Sheaf Topos","display":"Theorem — Continuous Flat Functors and Points of a Sheaf Topos","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-thm-sheaf-topos-points","aliases":["14-thm-sheaf-topos-points"],"display":"Theorem — Continuous Flat Functors and Points of a Sheaf Topos","depends_on":["[[14-df-flat-set-functor]]","[[14-df-grothendieck-topology]]","[[14-df-geometric-morphism]]","[[14-df-sheafification-functor-unit]]","[[14-df-yoneda-embedding]]","[[14-df-natural-isomorphism-fully-faithful-functor]]","[[14-df-identity-composite-functors]]","[[14-thm-tensor-hom-adjunction]]"],"source_status":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。","source_locator":"VII.5 Theorem 2 [bis]、Lemma 3、Corollary 4，印刷页 381–384；DjVu 第 196–198 图页"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-thm-sheaf-topos-points"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-thm-sheaf-topos-points</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Theorem — Continuous Flat Functors and Points of a Sheaf Topos"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"87956cc8ea885899\" href=\"?note=87956cc8ea885899\" title=\"14-df-flat-set-functor\">14-df-flat-set-functor</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3fcbbf29a7947555\" href=\"?note=3fcbbf29a7947555\" title=\"14-df-grothendieck-topology\">14-df-grothendieck-topology</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9752b779c5f463f9\" href=\"?note=9752b779c5f463f9\" title=\"14-df-geometric-morphism\">14-df-geometric-morphism</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4123133f8910827a\" href=\"?note=4123133f8910827a\" title=\"14-df-sheafification-functor-unit\">14-df-sheafification-functor-unit</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"99b72d10a7d872f5\" href=\"?note=99b72d10a7d872f5\" title=\"14-df-yoneda-embedding\">14-df-yoneda-embedding</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"637a464575207be3\" href=\"?note=637a464575207be3\" title=\"14-df-natural-isomorphism-fully-faithful-functor\">14-df-natural-isomorphism-fully-faithful-functor</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"dad26c5de724390a\" href=\"?note=dad26c5de724390a\" title=\"14-df-identity-composite-functors\">14-df-identity-composite-functors</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"9be0fca5551bd9d2\" href=\"?note=9be0fca5551bd9d2\" title=\"14-thm-tensor-hom-adjunction\">14-thm-tensor-hom-adjunction</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_status","html":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"VII.5 Theorem 2 [bis]、Lemma 3、Corollary 4，印刷页 381–384；DjVu 第 196–198 图页"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\mathcal C,J)\">\\((\\mathcal C,J)\\)</span> 是小站点，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(a,\\eta)\">\\((a,\\eta)\\)</span> 是层化函子，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\">\\(y\\)</span> 是 Yoneda 嵌入。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A:\\mathcal C\\to\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}\">\\(A:\\mathcal C\\to\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}\\)</span> 为协变函子。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f=(f^*,f_*)\">\\(f=(f^*,f_*)\\)</span> 是候选几何态射 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}\\to\\mathbf{Sh}(\\mathcal C,J)\">\\(\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}\\to\\mathbf{Sh}(\\mathcal C,J)\\)</span>，自然同构的定义见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"637a464575207be3\" href=\"?note=637a464575207be3\" title=\"14-df-natural-isomorphism-fully-faithful-functor\">14-df-natural-isomorphism-fully-faithful-functor</a>。本条的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsContinuousFlatSetFunctor}\">\\(\\mathrm{IsContinuousFlatSetFunctor}\\)</span> 限定为 flat 函子的覆盖条件；不把一般函子的联合满射条件直接等同于保持覆盖筛余极限。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{gathered}\n\\mathrm{IsContinuousFlatSetFunctor}(A,\\mathcal C,J)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{IsFlatSetFunctor}(A,\\mathcal C)\\land\n\\forall C\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\ \\forall S\\in J(C)\\ \\forall a_0\\in A(C)\\ \\exists u\\in S\\ \\exists b\\in A(\\mathrm{dom}(u))\\ (A(u)(b)=a_0),\\\\\n\\mathrm{IsContinuousFlatSetFunctor}(A,\\mathcal C,J)\\to\\exists f\\ \\exists\\alpha\\\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{IsGeometricMorphism}(f,\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U},\\mathbf{Sh}(\\mathcal C,J))\\land\\mathrm{IsNaturalIso}(\\alpha,A,f^*\\circ a\\circ y)\\bigr),\\\\\n\\mathrm{IsGeometricMorphism}(f,\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U},\\mathbf{Sh}(\\mathcal C,J))\\to\n\\mathrm{IsContinuousFlatSetFunctor}(f^*\\circ a\\circ y,\\mathcal C,J).\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{gathered}\n\\mathrm{IsContinuousFlatSetFunctor}(A,\\mathcal C,J)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{IsFlatSetFunctor}(A,\\mathcal C)\\land\n\\forall C\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\ \\forall S\\in J(C)\\ \\forall a_0\\in A(C)\\ \\exists u\\in S\\ \\exists b\\in A(\\mathrm{dom}(u))\\ (A(u)(b)=a_0),\\\\\n\\mathrm{IsContinuousFlatSetFunctor}(A,\\mathcal C,J)\\to\\exists f\\ \\exists\\alpha\\\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{IsGeometricMorphism}(f,\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U},\\mathbf{Sh}(\\mathcal C,J))\\land\\mathrm{IsNaturalIso}(\\alpha,A,f^*\\circ a\\circ y)\\bigr),\\\\\n\\mathrm{IsGeometricMorphism}(f,\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U},\\mathbf{Sh}(\\mathcal C,J))\\to\n\\mathrm{IsContinuousFlatSetFunctor}(f^*\\circ a\\circ y,\\mathcal C,J).\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书定位：VII.5 Theorem 2 [bis]、Lemma 3、Corollary 4，印刷页 381–384；DjVu 第 196–198 图页。</p>\n<p>原书实际证明一个范畴等价；本条形式断言抽取其对象存在和反向条件。对 flat <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>，<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"9be0fca5551bd9d2\" href=\"?note=9be0fca5551bd9d2\" title=\"14-thm-tensor-hom-adjunction\">14-thm-tensor-hom-adjunction</a> 的张量–Hom 伴随给预层拓扑斯的点。覆盖族联合满射等价于张量函子把覆盖筛包含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\hookrightarrow yC\">\\(S\\hookrightarrow yC\\)</span> 送为同构：覆盖筛表示为表示预层的余极限，张量保余极限；flatness 保单态射，故联合满性给同构。一般稠密预层包含可沿表示预层拉回后逐个处理，因而该点经层子拓扑斯因子化。反向，层化把覆盖筛包含变成同构，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f^*\">\\(f^*\\)</span> 保余极限和有限极限，得到覆盖条件与 flatness。正文不声称只检查覆盖族就能使任意协变函子成为 flat。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-flat-set-functor","status":"resolved","id":"87956cc8ea885899","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-flat-set-functor]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-grothendieck-topology","status":"resolved","id":"3fcbbf29a7947555","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-grothendieck-topology]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-geometric-morphism","status":"resolved","id":"9752b779c5f463f9","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-geometric-morphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-sheafification-functor-unit","status":"resolved","id":"4123133f8910827a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-sheafification-functor-unit]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-yoneda-embedding","status":"resolved","id":"99b72d10a7d872f5","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-yoneda-embedding]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-natural-isomorphism-fully-faithful-functor","status":"resolved","id":"637a464575207be3","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-natural-isomorphism-fully-faithful-functor]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-identity-composite-functors","status":"resolved","id":"dad26c5de724390a","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-identity-composite-functors]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-thm-tensor-hom-adjunction","status":"resolved","id":"9be0fca5551bd9d2","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-thm-tensor-hom-adjunction]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-natural-isomorphism-fully-faithful-functor","status":"resolved","id":"637a464575207be3","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$(\\mathcal C,J)$ 是小站点，$(a,\\eta)$ 是层化函子，$y$ 是 Yoneda 嵌入。$A:\\mathcal C\\to\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}$ 为协变函子。$f=(f^*,f_*)$ 是候选几何态射 $\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}\\to\\mathbf{Sh}(\\mathcal C,J)$，自然同构的定义见 [[14-df-natural-isomorphism-fully-faithful-functor]]。本条的 $\\mathrm{IsContinuousFlatSetFunctor}$ 限定为 flat 函子的覆盖条件；不把一般函子的联合满射条件直接等同于保持覆盖筛余极限。","embed":false},{"target":"14-thm-tensor-hom-adjunction","status":"resolved","id":"9be0fca5551bd9d2","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"原书实际证明一个范畴等价；本条形式断言抽取其对象存在和反向条件。对 flat $A$，[[14-thm-tensor-hom-adjunction]] 的张量–Hom 伴随给预层拓扑斯的点。覆盖族联合满射等价于张量函子把覆盖筛包含 $S\\hookrightarrow yC$ 送为同构：覆盖筛表示为表示预层的余极限，张量保余极限；flatness 保单态射，故联合满性给同构。一般稠密预层包含可沿表示预层拉回后逐个处理，因而该点经层子拓扑斯因子化。反向，层化把覆盖筛包含变成同构，$f^*$ 保余极限和有限极限，得到覆盖条件与 flatness。正文不声称只检查覆盖族就能使任意协变函子成为 flat。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"(\\mathcal C,J)","display":false},{"tex":"(a,\\eta)","display":false},{"tex":"y","display":false},{"tex":"A:\\mathcal C\\to\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}","display":false},{"tex":"f=(f^*,f_*)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}\\to\\mathbf{Sh}(\\mathcal C,J)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IsContinuousFlatSetFunctor}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{gathered}\n\\mathrm{IsContinuousFlatSetFunctor}(A,\\mathcal C,J)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{IsFlatSetFunctor}(A,\\mathcal C)\\land\n\\forall C\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\ \\forall S\\in J(C)\\ \\forall a_0\\in A(C)\\ \\exists u\\in S\\ \\exists b\\in A(\\mathrm{dom}(u))\\ (A(u)(b)=a_0),\\\\\n\\mathrm{IsContinuousFlatSetFunctor}(A,\\mathcal C,J)\\to\\exists f\\ \\exists\\alpha\\\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{IsGeometricMorphism}(f,\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U},\\mathbf{Sh}(\\mathcal C,J))\\land\\mathrm{IsNaturalIso}(\\alpha,A,f^*\\circ a\\circ y)\\bigr),\\\\\n\\mathrm{IsGeometricMorphism}(f,\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U},\\mathbf{Sh}(\\mathcal C,J))\\to\n\\mathrm{IsContinuousFlatSetFunctor}(f^*\\circ a\\circ y,\\mathcal C,J).\n\\end{gathered}","display":true},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"S\\hookrightarrow yC","display":false},{"tex":"f^*","display":false}],"bytes":2897,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-254","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-sheaf-topos-points|Theorem — Continuous Flat Functors and Points of a Sheaf Topos]]"},{"id":"af8af33cef1d96d9","anchor":"ref-101","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-sheaf-topos-points]]"},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-258","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-sheaf-topos-points]]"},{"id":"ffda0c0482667c45","anchor":"ref-180","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-sheaf-topos-points]]"},{"id":"c60ad289d123497b","anchor":"ref-255","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-sheaf-topos-points|Theorem — Continuous Flat Functors and Points of a Sheaf Topos]]"}],"outgoing":["87956cc8ea885899","3fcbbf29a7947555","9752b779c5f463f9","4123133f8910827a","99b72d10a7d872f5","637a464575207be3","dad26c5de724390a","9be0fca5551bd9d2"]}